    "detailed_description": "ELDRIMAR: The Card Game is a card-based roguelike where you take on the role of the warlord Saron and participate in all significant battles for the kingdom of Eldrimar.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game combines CCG (Collectible Card Game) and roguelike mechanics. Build decks from various cards, defeat enemies, use artifacts to enhance your abilities, and create new cards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFurthermore, the game features a storyline that narrates the entire history of the kingdom of Eldrimar, its rises, and falls. The story will span across centuries, allowing you to play as Alira, who becomes a demon, and as a demon turned vampire conquering the whole world. Discover how he managed to conquer the kingdom of Eldrimar!",
